## How to Apply

```bash
# Apply all changes
fluxus apply --select all{{ if .TargetVersion }} --target-version {{ .TargetVersion }}{{ end }} {{ join .Files " " }}

# Apply only P1 Breaking changes
fluxus apply --select p1{{ if .TargetVersion }} --target-version {{ .TargetVersion }}{{ end }} {{ join .Files " " }}

# Apply specific changes by ID
fluxus apply --select P1-20,P2-18{{ if .TargetVersion }} --target-version {{ .TargetVersion }}{{ end }} {{ join .Files " " }}

# Include commented-out config changes
fluxus apply --select all --include-comments{{ if .TargetVersion }} --target-version {{ .TargetVersion }}{{ end }} {{ join .Files " " }}
```
